{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03362","headline":"游称心寺 · 宋之问","name":"游称心寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"释事怀三隐，清襟谒四禅。\n江鸣潮未落，林晓日初悬。\n宝叶交香雨，金沙吐细泉。\n望谐舟客趣，思发海人烟。\n顾枥仍留马，乘杯久弃船。\n未忧龟负岳，且识鸟耘田。\n理契都无象，心冥不寄筌。\n安期庶可揖，天地得齐年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}